    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d32">

                <pb facs="0111" n="37" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg37"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/340</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-01T23:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 1, 1917, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 2, 6.15 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1241. An immense crowd of enthusiastic Russians have just left Embassy where they
                    came to extend salutation from free Russia to free America and at their earnest
                    and repeated request, I am now expressing their greetings to their brother
                    freemen in the United States. Speeches were made by several in the crowd and I
                    made response thereto. All of the speakers declared that Russia would not think
                    of making separate peace and they wished to hear no more from America about it.
                    They request that a wreath be laid on the grave of Washington and that their
                    best wishes for long life and happiness be conveyed to President Wilson.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
